.TH ABRAFLEXI-ISDS 1 "" "abraflexi-isds" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
abraflexi-isds \- synchronize Czech ISDS data messages to AbraFlexi Events
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B abraflexi-isds
[\fB\-e\fR|\fB\-\-environment\fR=\fIFILE\fR]
[\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-output\fR=\fIFILE\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Logs in to the configured Czech ISDS (Informační systém datových schránek)
data box, fetches received data messages, and creates an AbraFlexi Event
(evidence "udalost") for each message that has not been synced yet. Message
documents are attached to the Event, and the sender is linked to a matching
AbraFlexi Adresar record when its IČO can be resolved from the ISDS
directory. A JSON summary report is written to the output file.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-e ", " \-\-environment =\fIFILE\fR
Path to an environment file overriding /etc/abraflexi-isds/.env.template
defaults (ABRAFLEXI_*, ISDS_* variables, and the Data Box credential
variables LOGIN, PASSWORD, CERT_FILE, PRODUCTION, DATABOX_ID).
.TP
.BR \-o ", " \-\-output =\fIFILE\fR
Where to write the JSON summary report. Defaults to standard output.
.SH FILES
.I /etc/abraflexi-isds/.env.template
.RS
Template listing all recognized configuration variables.
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR abraflexi-tools (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Vítězslav Dvořák <info@vitexsoftware.cz>
